WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.387 --> 00:00:04.472
- What's up believe nation?

00:00:04.472 --> 00:00:07.045
I started the Never Sick
series because in January

00:00:07.045 --> 00:00:09.634
I got really, really sick
and I vowed to myself

00:00:09.634 --> 00:00:11.483
I never want to get sick again.

00:00:11.483 --> 00:00:14.156
I used to have the belief
system that told me that

00:00:14.156 --> 00:00:17.070
if anybody was around me,
I was going to get sick.

00:00:17.070 --> 00:00:19.987
If a coworker or my employee
was sick I would tell them,

00:00:19.987 --> 00:00:22.779
"Stay home, even if you have
a minor cough, stay home,

00:00:22.779 --> 00:00:24.132
"I don't want to be around
you 'cause I'm going to

00:00:24.132 --> 00:00:24.965
"get sick."

00:00:24.965 --> 00:00:27.371
And, as a result, I got sick a lot.

00:00:27.371 --> 00:00:29.455
And so I created the Never
Sick series because I wanted

00:00:29.455 --> 00:00:32.978
to gift myself and also
gift you guys the ability to

00:00:32.978 --> 00:00:36.627
improve our immune systems
and never get sick.

00:00:36.627 --> 00:00:38.516
The first video I was was on (mumbles),

00:00:38.516 --> 00:00:39.674
you guys can check that out.

00:00:39.674 --> 00:00:42.560
It was about using breathing
techniques and using

00:00:42.560 --> 00:00:45.230
the cold therapy to help you not get sick.

00:00:45.230 --> 00:00:47.768
I've been using that, I've
also been using just my own

00:00:47.768 --> 00:00:51.235
belief system and the good
news is, three months later,

00:00:51.235 --> 00:00:52.312
I still haven't gotten sick.

00:00:52.312 --> 00:00:54.608
We've been through a Canadian winter,

00:00:54.608 --> 00:00:56.355
crazy one with ups and down temperature,

00:00:56.355 --> 00:00:58.152
I've been traveling, been
around sick children,

00:00:58.152 --> 00:00:59.809
and I haven't gotten sick yet.

00:00:59.809 --> 00:01:00.996
Fingers crossed.

00:01:00.996 --> 00:01:03.333
And I wanted to share a new
video with you guys today

00:01:03.333 --> 00:01:06.766
about how to use your mind
to control your beliefs

00:01:06.766 --> 00:01:09.440
and control your illness and sicknesses.

00:01:09.440 --> 00:01:11.410
I haven't fully tested it on myself yet,

00:01:11.410 --> 00:01:13.390
but I'm going to be going
through the process and I'd

00:01:13.390 --> 00:01:15.808
love to know what you guys
think; if you're learning

00:01:15.808 --> 00:01:17.920
from it, if you're going to
apply it, if you've tried it

00:01:17.920 --> 00:01:20.376
and gotten results to not
get sick by using your

00:01:20.376 --> 00:01:22.951
belief system and psychology.

00:01:22.951 --> 00:01:24.535
And as always, guys, if you
hear something that really

00:01:24.535 --> 00:01:26.656
resonates with you, please
leave it down in the comments

00:01:26.656 --> 00:01:28.477
below, put quotes around
it so other people can be

00:01:28.477 --> 00:01:31.290
inspired, as well, and when
you write it down you're

00:01:31.290 --> 00:01:33.800
much more likely to lock it in, as well.

00:01:33.800 --> 00:01:34.633
Enjoy.

00:01:34.633 --> 00:01:37.216
(upbeat music)

